Lab copy of the OpenTelemetry Demo (Astronomy Shop)

This directory contains a modified copy of the OpenTelemetry Demo,
https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-demo, at tag 3.1.0
(commit dedc0178918e260823323b8d95005a8cb924b007).

Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE in this directory.

The upstream project ships no NOTICE file. Files copied from it keep their
copyright and licence headers. They were changed for the LGTM study lab:
services and observability backends were removed, calls to removed services
were replaced by in-process stand-ins, and two feature flags were backported
from the upstream main branch. Every change is listed in TRIMMING.md.
UPSTREAM.md records where the copy came from.

New files written for the lab (compose.yaml, Makefile, scripts/, chart/,
test/ and the documents) are also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
